    "result_text": "The full test suite passes. There's a single test class (`AcceptanceTest`; the other files are its base/helper), and it's green.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe change is in `AuditOwnerCreated.java`. The create audit line now also logs `membershipNumber` alongside the existing `id`, `customerCode`, `registrationDate`, and `membershipLevel` fields:\n\n- Added `membershipNumber={}` to the log format and passed the value.\n- Added a private `membershipNumber(Owner)` helper that reproduces the mapper's exact formula (`customerCode + \"-M\" + last two digits of registration year`, or `null` when either input is absent), so the audit line matches the `membershipNumber` returned by the API.\n\nThe new `AcceptanceTest.coreAuditIncludesLevelAndNumber` passes, and the sample audit line confirms the enrichment:\n\n```\nAUDIT - Owner created id=11 customerCode=NSW-16E6609E registrationDate=2026-09-07 membershipLevel=2 membershipNumber=NSW-16E6609E-M26\n```",
